{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK","doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserCreationOptions"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"appId"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"secret"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"linker"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:SENTUserLinker.h@T@SENTUserLinker","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinker","text":"SENTUserLinker"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil)"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"appId","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"– Your Sentiance app ID.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"secret","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"– Your Sentiance app secret.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"linker","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"– Linker which will be invoked to initiate user linking. When nil, an unlinked user will be created","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accepts Sentiance app credentials and a linker, to create a linked Sentiance user."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During the user creation process, the SDK will call the link method of the supplied SENTUserLinker, and will pass to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it an installation ID. Your app must then forward this installation ID to the Sentiance backend (via your backend),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and initiate user linking. Finally, when the linking completes, you must invoke the proper linker callback to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"complete the process."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the complete steps:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this initializer and supply your Sentiance app credentials and a linker. Your linker will be invoked during"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user creation process, and an installation ID will be supplied."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In your linker, forward the installation ID to your backend to initiate a linking request towards the Sentiance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backend. This request will include the installation ID and your app’s user identifier."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieve the response from the Sentiance backend and forward the result to the app."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the result, invoke the linker callback’s success or failure method. The callback is supplied to your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linker along with the installation ID. If it was successful, the SDK will confirm the result with the Sentiance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backend to complete the user creation."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can create an unlinked (anonymous) Sentiance user by specifying a nil linker. After doing so, you can link","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user at a later time by calling linkUserWithLinker:completionHandler or linkUserWithAuthCode:completionHandler","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on the Sentiance class. However, note that linking this way has certain limitations. An unlinked user cannot be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"linked to an app user that already exists on the Sentiance Platform (i.e. with an app user identifier that you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already supplied to Sentiance during a past linking request). You can only link to an app user that is new to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Sentiance. This is because an existing app user will already have a corresponding Sentiance user on the platform,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and that Sentiance user cannot be restored here anymore. To restore that user, you must reset the SDK and recreate a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"linked Sentiance user instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentusercreationoptions\/init(appid:secret:linker:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentusercreationoptions\/init(appid:secret:linker:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserCreationOptions\/init(appId:secret:linker:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserCreationOptions(im)initWithAppId:secret:linker:","symbolKind":"init","title":"init(appId:secret:linker:)","modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Initializer","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithAppId:secret:linker:","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"appId"},{"kind":"t